WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Developers” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Set the receiving URL
From Developers open the Webhooks section. Enter a public HTTPS URL that belongs to your system, not a dashboard page link.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Choose the events
Choose “Message received”, “Conversation closed” or “New lead” according to what the integration needs, then press “Add webhook” in your real account after preparing the receiver.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Managing the webhook
In the registered row you will see the pause/enable, delivery log and delete buttons. The recording shows a local training example and doesn't connect to an external receiver.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
The signature and the delivery log
Your system receives the signing secret on creation; store it safely and verify the HMAC signature as the documentation describes. Review the HTTP code, the result and the time in the delivery log.
